        {
          "id": "1712133285755994535",
          "text": "👎🏽 BITTERSWEET DEM PHONIES 👎🏽\n\nOn the anniversary of the Fed Tapes, a look at the legacy of the scandal and how its participants are working hard to rehabilitate themselves in public. Plus, the charges against Councilmember John “City Staffer B” Lee\n\nhttps://t.co/hJ2b4bl9Yq https://t.co/PMj8uBYvVU",
          "url": "https://x.com/thelapod/status/1712133285755994535",
          "lang": "en",
          "createdAt": "2023-10-11T15:49:19.000Z",
          "conversationId": "1712133285755994535",
          "inReplyToId": null,
          "author": {
            "id": "1125141238192021504",
            "username": "thelapod",
            "name": "LA Podcast",
            "verified": false,
            "followersCount": 6974,
            "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1230168394780958720/vikWsfV4_normal.jpg"
          },
          "likeCount": 10,
          "retweetCount": 7,
          "replyCount": 2,
          "viewCount": 5058,
          "quoteCount": 1,
          "bookmarkCount": 3,
          "media": [
            {
              "id": "1712133262477598720",
              "type": "photo",
              "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/F8K4IYYboAAnucH.jpg",
              "previewImageUrl": null
            }
