        },
        {
          "id": "1712487311869677647",
          "text": "“These people didn’t get together to talk about Mike Bonin’s family. That’s not why they were there. You can say, as apparently Nury is saying, it’s a high-pressure job and sometimes that makes me racist. No, they were there to do a racist thing.” 🎧 https://t.co/D4lItj5ghG https://t.co/ueIT6w9fGo",
          "url": "https://x.com/thelapod/status/1712487311869677647",
          "lang": "en",
          "createdAt": "2023-10-12T15:16:06.000Z",
          "conversationId": "1712487311869677647",
          "inReplyToId": null,
          "author": {
            "id": "1125141238192021504",
            "username": "thelapod",
            "name": "LA Podcast",
            "verified": false,
            "followersCount": 6974,
            "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1230168394780958720/vikWsfV4_normal.jpg"
