        {
          "id": "1709068730058346703",
          "text": "\"City Council has taken no action on the conduct of their colleague John Lee. City Council has sought no investigation into the conduct of their colleague John Lee. The citizens of Los Angeles expect and deserve more.\"\n\nFrom our own Scott Frazier in 2021\nhttps://t.co/EUlBSvVAeZ",
